      "title": "VEEV Raises FY27 Outlook as Vault CRM and AI Momentum Accelerate Fast",
      "summary": "Veeva Systems raised its fiscal 2027 revenue guidance to $3.682-$3.687B (implying ~15% growth), driven by strong Vault CRM adoption with commitments from 12 of top 20 biopharma firms and 180+ live customers. The company's Falcon AI product has five early adopters, though execution remains a key near-term priority. While profitability is maintained with a 44% operating margin, newer initiatives like CRM migrations and AI monetization still require sustained execution.",
