      "title": "Veeva Systems Q2 Earnings and Revenues Beat Estimates, Stock Up",
      "summary": "Veeva Systems (VEEV) reported Q2 fiscal 2027 adjusted EPS of $2.35, up 18.1% YoY and beating consensus by 5.9%, with revenues rising 17.6% to $928 million. The company raised its fiscal 2027 revenue guidance to $3.682-$3.687 billion and EPS to $9.21. Vault CRM momentum continued with over 180 customers live including five top 20 biopharmas, while the company advanced its AI strategy with Veeva Falcon.",
